@startuml intercom-statemachine
' 互传 — 接收端 UI 状态机
' 导出: plantuml -tpng -scale 2 intercom-statemachine.puml

skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam defaultFontName SimSun
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam roundcorner 14
skinparam state {
  BorderColor #3B82F6
  FontSize 13
}

title **互传接收端 UI 状态机 — NfcUiState**
footer 智能错题本 · 接收端状态机

state "**Idle**\n(空闲等待)" as Idle #EFF6FF
state "**Detected**\n(NFC 检测到会话)" as Detected #FEF3C7
state "**BroadcastDiscovering**\n(广播扫描中)" as Broadcasting #FCE7F3
state "**Importing**\n(正在接收与导入)" as Importing #DBEAFE
state "**Result**\n(导入成功)" as Result #DCFCE7
state "**Error**\n(导入失败)" as Error #FEE2E2

[*] --> Idle

Idle --> Detected: NFC Reader Mode\n检测到合法 sessionId
Idle --> Broadcasting: 用户点击"开始扫描"

Broadcasting --> Importing: 用户选择目标设备\n(connectToBroadcastDevice)
Broadcasting --> Idle: 点击"取消"

Detected --> Importing: 用户点击"确认导入"\n(启动 BLE 扫描)

Importing --> Importing: BLE NOTIFY 数据到达\n展示 SharePreview 预览
Importing --> Result: 数据接收完毕\nsessionId 校验通过\n逐条入库 + sendAck 成功
Importing --> Error: 45秒超时\n或 sessionId 不匹配\n或 BLE 连接失败
Importing --> Error: JSON 解码失败

Result --> Idle: 点击"完成"\n或 viewModel.reset()
Error --> Idle: 点击"重试"\n或 viewModel.reset()

note right of Importing
  设置 45 秒超时保护
  BLE NOTIFY Indication
  逐片累积拼接 JSON
end note

note right of Detected
  若 payload 非合法 UUID
  (交通卡干扰)
  不显示确认按钮，
  提示更换轻触位置
end note

@enduml
